// ============================================================
// PLATES: full-room background artwork, embedded as base64 so
// the game still works when index.html is opened straight off
// the disk (file:// blocks loading images from separate files).
//
// Same trick as core/sprites-real.js. One entry per venue.
// Each plate is pre-scaled to its exact world size in pixels,
// so it draws 1:1 with no filtering.
//
//   gonzos - 1536 x 864, Chapter 1 Area 1.
//            Source art: "Level Design/Gonzos/Gonzos_Level.jpg"
//            (2730 x 1536, downscaled here).
